msgstr "Akce"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Documents/index.php:80
#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/view.php:105
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Otevřít"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Documents/index.php:85
#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/view.php:110
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Stáhnout"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Documents/index.php:89
msgid "Content"
msgstr "Obsah"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Documents/index.php:94
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Odstranit"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Documents/index.php:96
msgid ""
"Remove this document from the record? The content itself goes only if nothing else "
"wants it."
msgstr ""
"Odebrat tento dokument ze záznamu? Samotný obsah zmizí, jen když ho nikdo jiný nechce."

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/index.php:13
#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/index.php:52
#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/view.php:46
msgid "MIME Type"
msgstr "MIME typ"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/index.php:19
msgid "Nothing points at it"
msgstr "Nic na něj neukazuje"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/index.php:26
msgid "Hash Begins With"
msgstr "Otisk začíná na"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/index.php:41
msgid ""
"Each piece of content once, however many records point at it. What nothing points at "
"any more is here too - that is the state a torn backup leaves behind, and the harmless "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Každý obsah jednou, bez ohledu na to, kolik záznamů na něj ukazuje. Je tu i to, na co "
"už neukazuje nic, protože přesně to po sobě nechá přetržená záloha, a je to ta neškodná "
"polovina."

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/index.php:51
msgid "Hash"
msgstr "Otisk"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/index.php:54
#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/view.php:68
msgid "File Links"
msgstr "Vazby souboru"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/index.php:68
msgid "nothing"
msgstr "nic"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/index.php:72
msgid "View"
msgstr "Zobrazit"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/index.php:82
msgid "{0} in the store, {1} in all, {2} of them pointed at by nothing."
msgstr "{0} v úložišti, {1} celkem, na {2} z nich neukazuje nic."

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/view.php:31
msgid ""
"The bytes this row stands for are not in the store. Nothing that points at it can be "
"handed over until they are put back."
msgstr ""
"Bajty, které tento řádek zastupuje, nejsou v úložišti. Dokud se nevrátí, nejde vydat "
"nic, co na ně ukazuje."

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/view.php:42
msgid "Hash Type"
msgstr "Typ otisku"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/view.php:54
msgid "Path"
msgstr "Cesta"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/view.php:62
msgid "Created By"
msgstr "Vytvořil"

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/view.php:72
msgid ""
"Nothing points at this content. It is what a backup taken while something was being "
"written leaves behind, and it is safe to throw away."
msgstr ""
"Na tento obsah nic neukazuje. Nechá ho po sobě záloha pořízená ve chvíli, kdy se něco "
"zapisovalo, a jde bez obav zahodit."

#: plugins/Files/templates/Storage/view.php:86
msgid "Foreign Key"
msgstr "Cizí klíč"

